@prefix sh: <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .
@prefix avcore: <https://purl.org/archimate/validation#> .
@prefix fixk: <https://purl.org/archimate/validation/conformance/fixture-kinds#> .

# Conformance oracle — expected results for fixture-concept-kinds-data.ttl
# Test data — never load into a working repository.
#
# 1. Entailment: after RDFS entailment over ontology/archimate.ttl plus the
#    fixture, the nodes typed both archimate:Element and archimate:Relationship
#    (or archimate:RelationshipConnector) are EXACTLY the focus nodes below.
# 2. Validation: validating that entailed graph against
#    validation/archimate_validation_core.ttl reports EXACTLY these violations,
#    matched on (sh:focusNode, sh:sourceShape).
#
# fixk:j1 and fixk:rel1 must not appear: a junction and a relationship take
# part in relationships without becoming elements.

[] a sh:ValidationResult ;
    sh:focusNode fixk:probe-both ;
    sh:sourceShape avcore:ConceptKindsDisjoint .
